{"ID":"20240205153741-tvbxd9t","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153741-tvbxd9t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153741-tvbxd9t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206111923-tornwrv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619184954-wklwgyo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1705,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619184954-wklwgyo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"丁香","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102908"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240709093750-r4mpspi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709093750-r4mpspi","updated":"20240709093755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四川丁香"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n【性状】\t干燥的花蕾略呈短棒状，长1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2cm，红棕色至暗棕色；下部为圆柱状略扁的萼管，长1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.3cm，宽约5mm，厚约3mm，基部渐狭小，表面粗糙，刻之有油渗出，萼管上端有4片三角形肥厚的萼；上部近圆球形，径约6mm，具花瓣4片，互相抱合。将花蕾剖开，可见多数雄蕊，花丝向中心弯曲，中央有一粗壮直立的花柱，质坚实而重，入水即沉；断面有油性，用指甲划之可见油质渗出；气强烈芳香，味辛。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t暖胃，温肾。治胃寒痛胀、呃逆、吐泻、痹痛、疝痛、口臭、牙痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206111924-z48g2km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206111924-z48g2km","updated":"20240206111924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111924-l297ie0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161522-gskc7ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161522-gskc7ah","updated":"20240205161522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"丁香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/丁香-20240205161522-gc64v01.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709083255-67u462l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709083255-67u462l","updated":"20240709083422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240709083255-239cz2i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 574px;","style":"width: 564px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"四川丁香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/四川丁香-20240709083414-pnyp1rx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 564px;\" parent-style=\"width: 574px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709082834-ko07yhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709082834-ko07yhw","updated":"20240709083441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 423px;","style":"width: 413px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"丁香4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/丁香4-20240709083222-yqys1j2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 413px;\" parent-style=\"width: 423px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 745px;","